9069
07:40:34,100 --> 07:40:39,500
You want them to figure out your pipeline and actually generate it without bound, which Grockbot is very good at.

9070
07:40:39,500 --> 07:40:46,380
And then you want it to actually make sure that your calendar is built, and it can access your calendar and do that every single time.

9071
07:40:46,380 --> 07:40:52,740
So these are all things that happen autonomously, and I no longer need to worry about 99% of this journey.

